{"parse": {"title": "FT-11", "pageid": 55367, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-10\" title=\"FT-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-11</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-12\" title=\"FT-12\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">11</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.82.89.E7.81.AB.E4.B8.8E.E9.93.81.E7.A0.A7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"炉火与铁砧\">炉火与铁砧</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 炉火与铁砧</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Ingle and Anvil</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>叮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>叮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>叮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>笃<span class=\"color-value\"></span>定<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>脚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>跟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>落<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>声<span class=\"color-value\"></span>音<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010111</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少许的灰烬飘浮在空气中，让人们内心的恐惧浮浮沉沉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“开业中”的招牌在门口孤零零地晃悠着，路过的人们行色匆匆，唯恐在店门前驻留。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>餐馆前所未有的冷清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304124.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-304124.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304124.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304124.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-304124.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304124.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-304124.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304124.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>是的……我现在正位于海特街379号待命。我已经嘱托了赶回基金会的两名职员，他们随后将带领你们过来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304124.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-304124.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304124.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304124.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-304124.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304124.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-304124.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304124.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>碍于事发突然……我会提前赶到那里，并向你们发送我最新的坐标位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">联络器：</div><div>这也许将是我们剿灭重塑之手的又一个新节点……玛蒂尔达小姐，您为我们提供了一个至关重要的讯息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">联络器：</div><div>请时刻保持联系……紧急援助小队将很快赶来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-304111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-304111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-304111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>另、另外……我还需要补充另一则消息……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她欲言又止，但还是说了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-304111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-304111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-304111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我们其中一位神秘学家朋友有可能已经叛投了重塑之手，唔……圣洛夫基金会的支援恐怕会被他们有所防范……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304126.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-304126.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304126.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304126.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-304126.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304126.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-304126.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304126.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这是我个人的疏忽，我希望允许我事先探路，为后续的支援提供帮助……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>联络器的另一端沉默片刻，响起了一阵喧嚣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随后，是一个斩钉截铁的答复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">联络器：</div><div>请务必遵守命令，在新纪元集市等待支援，玛蒂尔达调查员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304126.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-304126.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304126.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304126.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-304126.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304126.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-304126.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304126.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>好的……我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她咬紧嘴唇，沮丧地将联络器收回了口袋中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>增援的消息已经抵达，但她却无论如何也难以平复那焦躁的内心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>我听说，环状水星女士今早去了莱格斯的地界……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>……玛蒂尔达小姐，我们已经做到了力所能及的一切——这并非你的过错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摇了摇头，已无心答复这些安慰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>莱格斯和那帮神秘学家已经让新纪元集市脱离了轨道，我现在更需要保证的是你们的安全……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>从今早开始，J那个家伙就不见了人影……等基金会到达的时候，他必须得在这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>他去哪儿了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>假人耸了耸肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>他哪儿也没去……玛蒂尔达小姐，他就在这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他指了指厨房的后门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虚掩着的后门中，传来循序渐进的敲击声——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮、叮——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮、叮——叮！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走上前去，穿过拥挤的厨房，穿过满目的酱汁、生面包片、脏盘子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-304112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-304112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-304112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>他在……干什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>端着杯子的假人摇了摇头，拒绝了回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她打开了虚掩的门，步入其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>哈，说实话，我以为自己这辈子都不会再把这脏兮兮的东西拿出来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的锤子，犹如巨人的脚掌一般，重重砸在滚烫发红的金属上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我还记得那天，我老爸在客厅，神神秘秘地跟所有朋友说，他在那次旅行中，找到了世界上最了不得的宝物——自从我的母亲去世以后，谁也没见他那么高兴过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>人们都以为他从那堆光秃秃的土堆底下找到了什么好东西，巴结着他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>那时候我还是个乳臭未干、爱垂头丧气的小子，谁见了也不痛快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>等人们走光了，他让我穿上一身紧巴巴的制服，就像要才艺表演似的，领着一脸苦相的我去了天鹅绒餐厅……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>他牵着我的手，接着把另一个小姑娘带到我面前——说：“嘿，小伙子。我为你找了个妹妹。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我第一次见到了保利娜和她的母亲，我知道他没有撒谎，他确实为我们带来了宝物——一段慢悠悠的，踮着脚尖吃甜品，快活得能飘起来的日子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火星在他的瞳孔中，迸溅。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_at_duanjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_at_duanjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_at_duanjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>但作为一个穷困潦倒的保险推销员，从世代铸剑的维兰德家族里溜出来的私生子……他的野心太大，而力量又太小。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>维兰德……家族？我在第一防线学校编纂的《秘学与金属》里听过这个家族。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304124.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-304124.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304124.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304124.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-304124.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304124.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-304124.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304124.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>他们世代都是秘学冶金工匠，其中尤以铸剑盛名……可、可这个家族不是早已经在战争中灭亡了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>不管哪个时代，小家伙……那些弱小的人都会躲到阴暗的洞里面，学会隐藏自己的力量，只在真正需要它时，才去使用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>不够“胆小”的人，是无法存活的……老爸去世以后，我就比谁都明白这个道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>那些巴结他的人猜对了，他靠着家族留下来的“所罗门的手稿”，从遗迹底下翻出了一坨看上去一文不值、黑不溜秋的铁块儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-304113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>“所罗门的手稿”？……可这在圣洛夫基金会属于机密信息，不可能有其他人知道……你们把那个铁块儿藏在哪了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>一大半呢，早就成了我背上的那把东西，而剩下的余料……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>就在你眼前，小家伙……如今，跨越了这么长的时间，我才理解了我老爸，这确实是块好料子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>就像那些吉普赛巫婆，从听见孩童的第一声啼哭，就能断定他的一生是战士还是祭司一样——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>即便只是一块余料，但从我瞧见它的第一眼起，它也将注定是一把好刀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>而这会是它作为利刃的第一次出场。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩瞥见了他脚底下的布袋，以及——远处一辆老旧却擦得瓦亮的摩托车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……圣洛夫基金会的支援马上就要赶到，而且我已经破解了那把钥匙的术法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>J，你得好好呆在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>环状水星女士……已经加入了他们，我们无从得知她将会泄露什么情报……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>小家伙，我会亲自把我的朋友带回来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>那帮疯子的庆典将至，我不打算眼睁睁地看着生我养我的这条街分崩离析……同样，我也不打算等你姗姗来迟的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>你听我说，你根本没有任何必要以身犯险，圣洛夫基金会的支援很快就会到达，我们能最大程度地减小可能出现的伤亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>记住了，阅历丰富的调查员玛蒂尔达·布翁尼要教给你一个道理——准备万全才能把事情干得漂亮啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻人畅快地笑起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>哈哈哈，你说得没错，小家伙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>从我在街头摸爬滚打的日子来说，等一位警察、庇护人、老大——像是救世主那类的大人物——总是最优的选择，它能让我们避免无谓的流血与挨揍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我们都知道，怎么聪明地绕过麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我们会瞻前，与顾后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮——”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\"><img alt=\"zaluanxiaoxiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/600px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/900px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png/1200px-Cg-zaluanxiaoxiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老乞丐：</div><div>那是我所有的财产了，我恳求你们……那个空钱包对你们来说没有任何用处，里面就只有我妻子和女儿的照片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">地痞Ⅰ：</div><div>来呀，老不死的家伙……有种就自己过来把你的东西拿回去——哈哈哈，接住，伯顿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">地痞Ⅱ：</div><div>过来，在这边，在这边，老头……噢？！别挡道，你这个臭熏熏的狗杂种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乞丐布莱恩：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老乞丐：</div><div>帮帮我，布莱恩……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-612801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乞丐布莱恩：</div><div>抱歉，抱歉……朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他甩开老人哆哆嗦嗦的手，却始终没有迈开逃走的第一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我们忍让又谦逊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮——”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"waijiejiedao\"><img alt=\"waijiejiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/600px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/900px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/1200px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">修车铺老板：</div><div>霍利克，告诉我，你妈妈生你的时候是不是把你的脑子忘了？如果你再把昂贵的清洁剂用在这种破车上，半个子儿你都拿不到！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍利克：</div><div>可、可是……先生，顾客花钱买了这瓶清洁剂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-513701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">修车铺老板：</div><div>我还花钱雇了你这个蠢家伙呢！你是要听我的，还是滚回去陪你那个烧焦的修车铺白日做梦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他胆怯地垂下头，望着自己空荡荡的口袋，欲言又止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-309411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>谨慎又迟疑，量力而行，见好就收。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮——”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_guangyingrenqun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_guangyingrenqun\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_guangyingrenqun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-1_5_bg_guangyingrenqun.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_guangyingrenqun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-1_5_bg_guangyingrenqun.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_guangyingrenqun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-1_5_bg_guangyingrenqun.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_guangyingrenqun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝克特：</div><div>咳、咳……呸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">裁判：</div><div>10、9、8、7……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赌局庄家：</div><div>嘿、嘿，别再站起来了，蠢货！我保证，这局比赛结束后，肯定让你湿湿嘴！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赌局庄家：</div><div>你这个没卵蛋的家伙！躺下去，咱们谁都能赚个盆满钵满！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的身躯已经竭尽了气力，但拳头仍紧紧握着。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮、叮——叮！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>但如果你试过给这些剑淬火，就会明白，犹豫只会徒增裂纹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>滚烫的刀身坠入水中，瞬间涌起了无数气泡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>只有最闪烁的火遇上水，才能造就最好的钢——这个世道，还有另一种选择，另一种生活方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>它不需要你谨言慎行，不需要你万事俱备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他从水中拎出冷却好的剑身，置于柔软的裹布里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一把新的博伊刀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>因为——那些会颤抖的拳头，才拥有真正的力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我不会等待一切都准备好的，永远不会。你明白吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她踟蹰着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……呃，也许你说的是有些道理。但这已经严重违反了基金会此前下达的命令……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那焦躁的内心深处，一个答案已缓缓浮现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>因此……作为你的监督者，玛蒂尔达会牢牢跟紧你，防止你做出预料之外的蠢事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个头盔划过半空，丢到她的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>没问题，长官。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/82/Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_dianwancanguan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>服务员心无旁骛地正把桌子抹得反光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯普特尼克：</div><div>哼♫哼呵♬……嗯？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯普特尼克：</div><div>不对……那些放在这里的徽章，怎么全都不见了？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯普特尼克：</div><div>先驱者先生！先驱者先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而目光所及，只有门扇仍在摆动——趋于止息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“嗡、嗡——嗡！”</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-11"}}